sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor
    participant B as Browser (brief.js)
    participant W as Worker /api/enquiries
    participant D as D1
    participant R as Resend
    actor A as Admin

    V->>B: Completes 3-step form
    B->>B: Validate each step client-side
    B->>W: POST JSON (Origin header)
    W->>W: Same-origin check, honeypot check
    W->>D: UPSERT rate_limits (enquiry:ipHash)
    D-->>W: count
    alt over 5 per hour
        W-->>B: 429 Too many attempts
    end
    W->>W: Turnstile verify (if configured)
    W->>W: validate(enquirySchema)
    alt invalid
        W-->>B: 422 + field errors
        B->>B: Jump to step with first error
    end
    W->>D: INSERT enquiries (reference NP-XXXXXX)
    W-->>B: 201 { reference }
    B-->>V: Success panel with reference
    W--)R: waitUntil: send notification email
    R--)A: "New enquiry NP-XXXXXX"
    A->>W: Opens /admin, changes status to "contacted"
